1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,866
What if electrons disappeared for 5 seconds?

2
00:00:03,816 --> 00:00:07,406
Every atom on Earth is held together by them.

3
00:00:07,406 --> 00:00:11,808
The moment they vanish, matter loses its negative charge.

4
00:00:11,808 --> 00:00:15,186
And positive charges violently repel.

5
00:00:15,186 --> 00:00:21,037
Your hands, the ground, and the skyscrapers explode into subatomic dust.

6
00:00:21,037 --> 00:00:24,787
Five seconds later, electrons return.

7
00:00:24,787 --> 00:00:29,335
Every electron returns to a world that no longer exists.

